### Module API Tests
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001/api/v1

### 1. Get All Modules - Success
GET {{baseUrl}}/modules

### 2. Get All Modules - Check Cache (run after test 1)
GET {{baseUrl}}/modules

### 3. Get Module by ID - Success
# Replace {moduleId} with actual ID from test 1 response
GET {{baseUrl}}/modules/{moduleId}

### 4. Get Module by ID - Not Found (Should Fail)
GET {{baseUrl}}/modules/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### 5. Get Module by ID - Invalid UUID (Should Fail)
GET {{baseUrl}}/modules/invalid-uuid

### 6. Get Module by Category - DIGITAL_PRESENCE
GET {{baseUrl}}/modules/category/DIGITAL_PRESENCE

### 7. Get Module by Category - PROCESS_ORGANIZATION
GET {{baseUrl}}/modules/category/PROCESS_ORGANIZATION

