### 17. Get Questions for Module - No Filters
# Replace {moduleId} with actual ID from test 1 response
GET {{baseUrl}}/modules/{moduleId}/questions

### 18. Get Questions for Module - Filter by Industry (TECHNOLOGY)
# Replace {moduleId} with actual ID from test 1 response
GET {{baseUrl}}/modules/{moduleId}/questions?industry=TECHNOLOGY

### 19. Get Questions for Module - Filter by Size (SMALL)
# Replace {moduleId} with actual ID from test 1 response
GET {{baseUrl}}/modules/{moduleId}/questions?size=SMALL

### 20. Get Questions for Module - Filter by Industry and Size
# Replace {moduleId} with actual ID from test 1 response
GET {{baseUrl}}/modules/{moduleId}/questions?industry=RETAIL&size=MEDIUM

### 21. Get Questions for Module - Invalid Module ID (Should Fail)
GET {{baseUrl}}/modules/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/questions

### 22. Get Questions for Module - Filter by Industry (HEALTHCARE)
# Replace {moduleId} with actual ID from test 1 response
GET {{baseUrl}}/modules/{moduleId}/questions?industry=HEALTHCARE

### 23. Get Questions for Module - Filter by Industry (MANUFACTURING)
# Replace {moduleId} with actual ID from test 1 response
GET {{baseUrl}}/modules/{moduleId}/questions?industry=MANUFACTURING

